          "source_refs": [
            "docs/agent/README.md",
            "docs/agent/candidates/README.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rule-evolution.review",
          "kind": "safety",
          "text": "事实类候选可凭明确确认应用；约定、偏好和安全规则必须由用户确认，任何候选都不得自动放宽权限、发布、删除数据或访问控制边界。",
          "source_refs": [
            "docs/agent/README.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rule-evolution.apply",
          "kind": "convention",
          "text": "应用候选使用 `node tools/agent-rules.mjs apply <candidate-id> --confirm <candidate-id>`；非事实规则还需 `--reviewed-by <name>`。",
          "source_refs": [
            "docs/agent/README.md",
